STUDENTS -> STUDENT_INTAKES:student_id [arrowtail="teetee",arrowhead="crowodot",taillabel="1",headlabel="0..*"];
INTAKES -> STUDENT_INTAKES:intake_id [arrowtail="teetee",arrowhead="crowodot",taillabel="1",headlabel="0..*"];
